sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code / Notebook
    participant SDK as kubeflow SDK
    participant K8sClient as kubernetes<br/>Python Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP TLS
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>(TrainJob Controller)
    participant Katib as Kubeflow Katib<br/>(Experiment Controller)
    participant SparkOp as Spark Operator<br/>(SparkConnect Controller)
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Training Workflow

    User->>SDK: trainer.train(model, dataset, config)
    SDK->>K8sClient: Create TrainJob CR
    Note right of SDK: KubernetesBackendConfig<br/>(namespace, kubeconfig)
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/trainer.kubeflow.org/v1/trainjobs<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / SA token
    K8sAPI->>Trainer: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Trainer-->>K8sAPI: Create training Pods
    K8sAPI-->>K8sClient: TrainJob status
    K8sClient-->>SDK: Status response
    SDK-->>User: Training job handle

    Note over User,S3: Hyperparameter Optimization Workflow

    User->>SDK: optimizer.tune(objective, params)
    SDK->>K8sClient: Create Experiment CR
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/katib.kubeflow.org/v1beta1/experiments<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / SA token
    K8sAPI->>Katib: Watch event: Experiment created
    Katib-->>K8sAPI: Create trial runs
    K8sAPI-->>K8sClient: Experiment status
    K8sClient-->>SDK: Trial results
    SDK-->>User: Optimization results

    Note over User,S3: Spark Workflow

    User->>SDK: spark.submit(app, config)
    SDK->>K8sClient: Create SparkConnect CR
    K8sClient->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/sparkoperator.k8s.io/v1alpha1/sparkconnects<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / SA token
    K8sAPI->>SparkOp: Watch event: SparkConnect created
    SparkOp-->>K8sAPI: Create Spark driver/executor Pods
    K8sAPI-->>K8sClient: SparkConnect status
    K8sClient-->>SDK: Spark session
    SDK-->>User: Spark session handle

    Note over User,S3: Model Registry Workflow

    User->>SDK: hub.push(model_artifact)
    SDK->>ModelReg: Register model artifact
    ModelReg-->>SDK: Model metadata
    SDK-->>User: Registered model reference

    Note over User,S3: Optional: S3 Storage (RHAI extra)

    User->>SDK: trainer.rhai.save_checkpoint()
    SDK->>S3: PUT checkpoint<br/>Auth: AWS credentials<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    S3-->>SDK: Upload confirmation
    SDK-->>User: Checkpoint saved
